abstract: >
  AetherHuman is the eleventh candidate of the Aether family.
  v2.0.0 is the current release, which includes Phase 2 completion
  (Independent Review signed by Jonathan Rabe), the Stronger Argument
  Memo for H-F2, the Evaluation Design, and the Adversarial Threat Model.
  The original paper (v1.0.0) remains available at 10.5281/zenodo.24278322.
